{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついにBloG更新が100回目になりました‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ばんざーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がいつもBloGの最初にかいているこの4行。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊\nいつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます\n＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんへの感謝の気持ちを忘れないように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いきもちで読めるように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも最初にかいています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの三要素は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ\nファッション\n自由"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前からBloGをかくのめっちゃ楽しみにしてて\n毎日更新しよう‼\nと思ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真も沢山載せて、\nもっと乃木坂46を知ってもらえるように:D\n伊藤万理華を知ってもらえるように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日更新は達成できてないけどね、\nこうやって100回目までこれたのは\nみなさんがいるから^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかくてやさしくて\n時におこって\n時に泣いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に喜んで\n一緒に悲しんで\n一緒に笑って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、家族じゃないかっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂family"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な存在です。\n...て前に同じこと言ってた‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のBloGのこのノリは\nずっと変わることはないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日のこと、思っていること\n全部自分の感覚でかいてるからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由にね:D♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも楽しんで、\n言いたいこと言えるBloGを\n更新しよううんそうしよう‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも走る‼走る‼\n走るぞうらーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の名古屋個別握手会楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいしゃべってにぎにぎしましょっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/2009870/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}